{"server":"en","storyId":"main_4_level_main_04-06_end","groupId":"main_4","stageId":"main_04-06","title":"Ignorance","storyCode":"4-6","avgTag":"After Operation","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_04-06_end.txt","sourceHash":"923875d7c3afeeee2a102cb790b9c39b21e1fa5043439ec8106f9bf12adf5a74","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"After the battle, Ch'en is already nowhere to be seen.\nGiven the risks posed by operating in an Originium-rich environment, Amiya leads Rhodes Island deeper into the city after communicating with Hoshiguma, having the L.G.D. stay on the periphery to serve as support.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三十二关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We've defeated Reunion's forces!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Bah. For a bunch of roadblocks, these guys were a bit tough."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"There's no sign of Ch'en."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're in a real mess now..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"She's not responding to my calls either! Tsk... This part of her hasn't ever changed."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D.! All members, prepare to follow me--"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"No, Inspector Hoshiguma."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"You should let us handle it."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"We're approaching the Originium-dense zones left by the Catastrophe..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"If you go any further, the healthy risk being infected by Oripathy."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"These consequences are too dire."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Furthermore, as Infected..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Hah. Given your small stature, it's cute when you try to give serious speeches."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Eh? Huh?!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Hahaha, I was just giving you a hard time."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"But you don't have to persuade me. I understand your concern."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"L.G.D.! We will be Rhodes Island's shield!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Block the entrance, and don't let a single Reunion member enter or exit!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"We'll let the experts handle this problem!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Inspector..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Oh, just call me Hoshiguma."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Go. Please take care of Ch'en."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Make sure you bring her back with you in one piece."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"I will, Hoshiguma...! I swear I'll bring Madam Ch'en back safely...!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Hoshiguma","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"Make sure to stay safe yourselves."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Okay!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Doctor, please follow me."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"Rhodes Island, let's go!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(Wait for me, Madam Ch'en...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(Frostleaf, Meteorite, Jessica...)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Amiya","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"(You have to stay strong!)"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cher_3"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"We've retrieved the recon team that we were last in contact with."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Medic","speakerId":"char_016_medic","isRemote":false,"text":"It's... looking really bad..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Rubor, hypothermia, and necrosis..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"What's going on here?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Wounded Operator","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"Ngh..."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Kal'tsit","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Completely frostbitten...?"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["Amiya"]},{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["Kal'tsit"]},{"speakerId":"char_016_medic","aliases":["Medic"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["Hoshiguma"]}]}
